<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{% block title %}usecode — infrastructure provisioning for your coding agent{% endblock %}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{% block description %}usecode is a free, open source MCP server that lets your coding agent provision real infrastructure — servers, volumes, networks, DNS — across Hetzner, AWS, Google Cloud, Azure and more. Without it, the agent writes the app and hands you a console.{% endblock %}" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"%3E%3Crect width="100" height="100" rx="22" fill="%2315181d"/%3E%3Cpath d="M30 24c-7 0-9 4-9 10v8c0 4-3 8-7 8 4 0 7 4 7 8v8c0 6 2 10 9 10M70 24c7 0 9 4 9 10v8c0 4 3 8 7 8-4 0-7 4-7 8v8c0 6-2 10-9 10" fill="none" stroke="%235eead4" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/%3E%3Cpath d="M38 38v12a12 12 0 0 0 24 0V38" fill="none" stroke="%23fff" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/%3E%3C/svg%3E' />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/site.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="wrap topbar-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/">usecode<span>.dev</span></a>
        <nav class="nav">
          <a href="/getting-started" class="{{ 'active' if page == 'getting-started' }}">Getting started</a>
          <a href="/team" class="{{ 'active' if page == 'team' }}">Team</a>
          <a href="{{ repo_url }}">GitHub</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>{% block body %}{% endblock %}</main>

    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="wrap footer-inner">
        <p>usecode — infrastructure provisioning over MCP. All of it public under the {{ license_name }}; nothing waiting behind a sales call.</p>
        <p class="muted">
          <a href="{{ repo_url }}">Source</a> ·
          <a href="/getting-started">Docs</a> ·
          <a href="/team">Team</a> ·
          <a href="{{ source_license_url }}">Licence</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
